# 01-discovery/

Source intake for `{{PROJECT_TITLE}}`. Captures who, what, why, and the
business context **before** any solution thinking.

| File                         | Purpose                                  | Owner             |
| ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------- |
| `00-product-sense.md`        | One-page product orientation             | Business Analyst  |
| `01-project-brief.md`        | Project charter / brief                  | Project Manager   |
| `02-business-context.md`     | Current state, pain points, outcomes     | Business Analyst  |
| `03-initial-scope.md`        | First scope cut (in/out)                 | Project Manager   |
| `04-stakeholder-map.md`      | Stakeholders, roles, influence           | Business Analyst  |
| `05-initial-process-flow.md` | Current-state process flow               | Business Analyst  |

Source of truth for discovery output. Anti-fiction: capture only what was
said or read; mark gaps as open questions.
